{
  "type": "function",
  "function": {
    "name": "propose_blueprint",
    "description": "Prepare a reviewable application Blueprint proposal from structured business requirements. Return Actors, Goals, business Modules, and task-oriented Scenarios with stable IDs, plus directed ModelRelation edges connecting each Goal to its Actors and each Module to its Scenarios. A Scenario may belong to multiple Modules. Every Goal must include at least one accountable or participating Actor by actorKey. This function does not save or modify the site\u0027s Blueprint; a user must review the result and explicitly accept it.",
